# scrub_check.py's site-specific denylist must never live inside this repo -- it names
# internal hosts and venture names (feedback_never_publish_infrastructure_shape.md).
# Defensive only: the real copy lives at ~/.config/squire/scrub-denylist.txt, outside
# any repo, but this blocks an accidental local copy from being added here too.
scrub-denylist.txt
.scrub-denylist*

